      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;problem-overview&#34;&gt;Problem Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for ways to convert a month number to its abbreviated or full name? Or vice versa? This guide covers &lt;strong&gt;16 practical and efficient methods&lt;/strong&gt; to achieve this in Python. Whether you&amp;rsquo;re working with &lt;code&gt;calendar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;datetime&lt;/code&gt;, or custom logic, you’ll find solutions tailored to your needs.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;solution-1-using-strptime-from-the-time-module&#34;&gt;Solution 1: Using &lt;code&gt;strptime&lt;/code&gt; from the &lt;code&gt;time&lt;/code&gt; Module&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Convert a month abbreviation to a month number:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; time &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; strptime&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;month_number &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; strptime(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Feb&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;%b&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;tm_mon&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;print(month_number)  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;# Output: 2&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;solution-2-leveraging-the-calendar-module&#34;&gt;Solution 2: Leveraging the 